        <div class="panel-body watch-body">
          <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_1108 20260622 — Jing「MV 面板只留 MV 媒体框」: 撤掉 Music/Lyrics/Script/
               Comments/Revenue/Ownership 六个标签(原本已隐藏)。Music(纯音频)档也撤 —— 因为 $0.69
               聆听 = 现在的幻灯/画面(等同音频体验), 特斯拉等阻止视频也 fallback 到幻灯, 无需独立音频页。
               收益→作品中心; 其余内容(歌词作为情绪字幕已在画面内)。保留的 mv 标签 + 各 pane DOM 暂留
               (JS 守卫引用), 仅隐藏入口, 零回归; 以后可彻底删 pane。 -->
          <div class="watch-tabs cssmv-pill-bar" role="tablist" data-pill-bar>
            <button class="watch-tab active" id="watch-tab-mv" type="button" data-watch-tab="mv" data-i18n="watch.tab.mv">MV</button>
            <button class="watch-tab" id="watch-tab-music" type="button" data-watch-tab="music" data-i18n="watch.tab.music" hidden style="display:none">Music</button>
            <button class="watch-tab" id="watch-tab-lyrics" type="button" data-watch-tab="lyrics" data-i18n="watch.tab.lyrics" hidden style="display:none">Lyrics</button>
            <button class="watch-tab" id="watch-tab-script" type="button" data-watch-tab="script" data-i18n="watch.tab.script" hidden style="display:none">Script</button>
            <button class="watch-tab" id="watch-tab-comments" type="button" data-watch-tab="comments" data-i18n="watch.tab.comments" hidden style="display:none">Comments</button>
            <button class="watch-tab" id="watch-tab-revenue" type="button" data-watch-tab="revenue" data-i18n="watch.tab.revenue" hidden style="display:none">Revenue</button>
            <button class="watch-tab" id="watch-tab-ownership" type="button" data-watch-tab="ownership" data-i18n="watch.tab.ownership" hidden style="display:none">Ownership</button>
          </div>
          <div class="watch-pane active" id="watch-pane-mv" data-watch-pane="mv">
            <div class="engine-progress-shell" id="kara-progress-shell" data-engine-progress="kara" hidden>
              <div class="engine-progress-title" data-i18n="status.karaokeSync">Karaoke Sync</div>
              <div class="engine-progress-bar"><span id="kara-progress"></span></div>
              <div class="engine-progress-detail" id="kara-progress-detail"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="watch-frame">
              <div class="watch-screen">
                <div id="watch-screen-backdrop" class="watch-screen-backdrop"></div>
                <!-- CSSOS_PHASE2_NO_VIDEO_LOOP 20260428 #166 — Jing:
                     "新的媒体1分钟反反复复播放" — loop attribute caused
                     short final_mv.mp4 to repeat indefinitely on top of
                     legacy audio. MV Pipeline runs are linear; no loop. -->
                <video id="watch-video" class="watch-video" autoplay muted playsinline></video>
                <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_437 20260526 — Jing「DevTools 手机模式 CORS 报错」: dropped
                     crossorigin. Frames/covers now live on cdn.cssstudio.app (R2), whose
                     custom-domain serving does NOT echo Access-Control-Allow-Origin, so a
                     crossorigin <img> was CORS-BLOCKED (net::ERR_FAILED) → frame fails to
                     load → black/flicker. Nothing reads #watch-svg into a canvas (the
                     first-frame/color sampler reads the <video>, which keeps its own
                     crossorigin), so the attribute is unnecessary here. Without it the
                     image loads normally, no CORS gate. -->
                <img id="watch-svg" class="watch-svg" alt="MV preview" />
                <button id="watch-style-shift" class="watch-style-shift" type="button" aria-label="Shuffle title style">✦</button>
                <button id="watch-overlay-play" class="watch-overlay-play" type="button" data-i18n-aria="action.watch" aria-label="Watch">
                  <span class="watch-overlay-play-ring"></span>
                  <span class="watch-overlay-play-icon">▶</span>
                </button>
                <div class="watch-karaoke-line" id="watch-karaoke-line"></div>
                <div class="watch-subtitle" id="watch-subtitle" data-i18n="status.composing">
                  CSS is composing...
                </div>
                <div class="watch-commerce-actions" id="watch-commerce-actions" hidden></div>
                <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_733 — Jing: 播放时低调显示当前 work 🆔, 跟 chrome(is-playback-clean)一起显隐。 -->
                <div class="watch-work-id" id="watch-work-id" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="watch-frame-progress" id="watch-frame-progress" hidden>
                <div class="watch-frame-progress-line"><span id="watch-frame-progress-fill"></span></div>
                <div class="watch-frame-progress-copy" id="watch-frame-progress-copy"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="watch-engine-grid" id="watch-engine-grid"></div>
            <div class="kara-runtime-board" id="kara-runtime-board"></div>
          </div>
            <div class="watch-pane" id="watch-pane-music" data-watch-pane="music">
              <div class="watch-info-card">
                <div class="watch-music-stage" id="watch-music-stage">
                  <div class="watch-frame-progress watch-music-frame-progress" id="watch-music-frame-progress" hidden>
                    <div class="watch-frame-progress-line"><span id="watch-music-frame-progress-fill"></span></div>
                    <div class="watch-frame-progress-copy" id="watch-music-frame-progress-copy"></div>
                  </div>
                  <button id="watch-music-style-shift" class="watch-style-shift watch-music-style-shift" type="button" aria-label="Shuffle title style">✦</button>
                  <div class="watch-music-aura"></div>
                  <div class="watch-music-ring" id="watch-music-ring">
                    <div class="watch-music-disc" id="watch-music-disc">
                    <div class="watch-music-art" id="watch-music-art"></div>
                    <div class="watch-music-hole"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <!-- CSSOS_PHASE2_MUSIC_TAB_SUBTITLE 20260426 #131 — Jing
                     "Music标签页，除了黑胶唱片之外，其余可以复用MV标签页的很多元素"
                     Mirror karaoke + subtitle text from the MV pane so the
                     Music tab also shows the active lyric line at the
                     bottom-center of the music stage. The mirror watcher
                     lives in app.watch-media-layout-p2100.js. -->
                <div class="watch-karaoke-line watch-music-karaoke-line" id="watch-music-karaoke-line"></div>
                <div class="watch-subtitle watch-music-subtitle" id="watch-music-subtitle"></div>
                <button id="watch-music-play" class="watch-music-play" type="button" data-i18n-aria="action.listen" aria-label="Listen">
                  <span id="watch-music-play-icon">▶</span>
                </button>
              </div>
              <input id="watch-music-art-blur" type="checkbox" hidden>
              <div class="watch-seed-copy" id="watch-seed-copy"></div>
              <audio id="watch-audio-preview" class="watch-audio-preview" preload="none"></audio>
              <div class="watch-audio-debug" id="watch-audio-debug" hidden>
                <div class="watch-audio-debug-line" id="watch-audio-debug-source"></div>
                <div class="watch-audio-debug-line" id="watch-audio-debug-path"></div>
                <div class="watch-audio-debug-line" id="watch-audio-debug-state"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="watch-mic-capture-card" id="watch-mic-capture-card"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="watch-pane" id="watch-pane-lyrics" data-watch-pane="lyrics">
            <div class="watch-info-card">
              <div class="watch-info-kicker" data-i18n="watch.lyrics.kicker">Lyrics</div>
              <textarea id="watch-lyrics-editor" class="watch-editor" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
              <div class="watch-info-kicker" data-i18n="watch.lyrics.style">Music Style</div>
              <input id="watch-lyrics-music-style" class="watch-editor watch-editor-short" type="text" />
              <div class="watch-info-kicker" data-i18n="watch.lyrics.wiki">Wiki Source</div>
              <input id="watch-lyrics-wiki-source" class="watch-editor watch-editor-short" type="text" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="watch-pane" id="watch-pane-script" data-watch-pane="script">
            <div class="watch-info-card">
              <div class="watch-info-kicker" data-i18n="watch.script.outline">Video Outline</div>
              <textarea id="watch-outline-editor" class="watch-editor watch-editor-short" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
              <div class="watch-info-kicker" data-i18n="watch.script.prompts">Section Prompts</div>
              <textarea id="watch-script-editor" class="watch-editor" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="watch-pane" id="watch-pane-comments" data-watch-pane="comments">
            <div class="watch-info-card">
              <div class="watch-info-kicker" data-i18n="watch.comments.kicker">Comments</div>
              <div class="watch-meta-copy" id="watch-comments-copy" data-i18n="watch.comments.empty">No comments yet.</div>
              <div class="watch-activity" id="watch-comments-list"></div>
              <form class="watch-comment-form" id="watch-comment-form">
                <input id="watch-comment-input" class="watch-comment-input" type="text" placeholder="Say something..." />
                <button id="watch-comment-submit" class="watch-comment-submit" type="submit">Send</button>
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="watch-pane" id="watch-pane-revenue" data-watch-pane="revenue">
            <div class="watch-info-card">
              <div class="watch-info-kicker" data-i18n="watch.revenue.kicker">Revenue</div>
              <div class="watch-meta-grid" id="watch-revenue-grid"></div>
              <div class="watch-activity" id="watch-revenue-activity"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="watch-pane" id="watch-pane-ownership" data-watch-pane="ownership">
            <div class="watch-info-card">
              <div class="watch-info-kicker" data-i18n="watch.ownership.kicker">Ownership</div>
              <div class="watch-meta-copy" id="watch-ownership-copy"></div>
              <div class="watch-activity" id="watch-ownership-list"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="resize-handle"></div>
      </section>

