    <footer class="dock" id="dock" data-pill-bar data-pill-compact>
      <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_163 20260515 — Jing: "自从加入了 🌌 System MVs，
           MV PIPELINE 面板就丢失了，请找回来". The MV Pipeline dock item
           had gone missing from index.html — DOCK_DEFAULT_ORDER lists
           "mv-pipeline" first, but restoreDockOrder() only renders
           actions that have a matching STATIC .dock-item, so a missing
           item is silently dropped. Restored here as a first-class
           static dock entry; buildBuiltinDockActionMap() carries the
           matching "mv-pipeline" → openMvPipelinePanel() handler. -->
      <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_489 20260529 — Jing「话筒默认就在第一位, 别先渲染别处再飞过去」。
           话筒 = 默认激活项, 而激活项跳第一(W487)。把它放在静态 HTML 第一个, 这样
           JS/pill-bar 还没跑时, 用户进来话筒就已经在第一位, 不会看到它从别处飞来。
           DOCK_DEFAULT_ORDER 与 DOCK_FRONT_PINNED 也同步把 mic 排到最前。 -->
      <!-- Dock order: Mic → MV Pipeline → (person-mv injected here) → For You → rest -->
      <div data-action="mic" data-pill-key="mic" data-hold="mic" class="active">
        <span class="dock-mic-icon dock-icon-media">
          <img class="dock-mic-img dock-mic-a" src="assets/dock-mic-1.webp?v=20260529-w495-webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
          <img class="dock-mic-img dock-mic-b" src="assets/dock-mic-2.webp?v=20260529-w495-webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
        </span>
        <span data-i18n="dock.mic">Mic</span>
      </div>
      <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_862 — Jing: 为你创作(For You)默认第二位(话筒之后), 静态 HTML 同步, 避免 JS 跑前飞位。 -->
      <div data-action="foryou" data-pill-key="foryou">✨ <span data-i18n="dock.foryou">For You</span></div>
      <div data-action="mv-pipeline" data-pill-key="mv-pipeline">🎞️ <span data-i18n="dock.mvPipeline">MV Pipeline</span></div>
      <div data-action="works" data-pill-key="works">🗂 <span data-i18n="dock.works">Works</span></div>
      <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_486 20260529 — Jing: 删除 🎬 CSS MV dock 项。它和 🎞️ MV
           Pipeline 打开同一个面板(WAVE_147 起被重指向管线), 纯重复, 还导致
           "点 CSS MV 却激活 MV 管线"。交付仪表盘仍可经 Reports / Delivery Ops
           进入。cssmv-panel 与其 handler 保留, 仅移除这颗重复的 dock 胶囊。 -->
      <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_838 20260616 — Jing: 删除 歌词/音乐/视频 三个早期"臆念"引擎面板的 Dock 入口。
           功能早整合进 MV 面板(左下打字机歌词 + 6 胶囊进度),单独入口=空壳+写死假数据=画蛇添足,
           让平台显得没完工(英伟达/苹果 Guideline 4 的"杂乱"观感)。面板 DOM 暂留作管线舞台可视化,
           只撤 Dock 重复入口。一切创作输出统一在 MV 面板,从入口到欣赏只一步。 -->
      <div data-action="watch" data-pill-key="watch">▶ <span data-i18n="dock.watch">MV</span></div>
      <div data-action="notifications" data-pill-key="notifications">🔔 <span class="dock-notification-badge" id="dock-notification-badge" hidden>0</span><span data-i18n="dock.notifications">Notifications</span></div>
      <div data-action="about" data-pill-key="about">ℹ <span data-i18n="dock.about">About</span></div>
      <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_840 20260616 — Jing: API/订阅/积分 三个钱面板归一成一个"账户"入口。
           订阅 pill 改名"账户"(主视图), 积分(信用奖惩)+API(密钥计费)入口收进账户面板顶部
           导航(app.subscription-panel.js account-hub-nav)。删 API/Credit 两个 Dock pill, 减少
           Dock 重复、回应苹果 Guideline 4。两面板 DOM 与功能保留, 仅入口归拢。 -->
      <div data-action="subscription" data-pill-key="subscription">💎 <span data-i18n="dock.account">Account</span></div>
      <div data-action="workspaces" data-pill-key="workspaces">🗂 <span data-i18n="dock.workspaces">Workspaces</span></div>
      <div data-action="user-admin" data-pill-key="user-admin">🧑‍💼 <span data-i18n="dock.userAdmin">User</span></div>
      <div data-action="settings" data-pill-key="settings">⚙ <span data-i18n="dock.settings">Settings</span></div>
      <div data-action="reports" data-pill-key="reports">📊 <span data-i18n="dock.reports">Reports</span></div>
      <div data-action="delivery-ops" data-pill-key="delivery-ops">🛰 <span data-i18n="dock.deliveryOps">Delivery Ops</span></div>
      <div data-action="system-mvs" data-pill-key="system-mvs">🌌 <span data-i18n="dock.systemMvs">System MVs</span></div>
      <div data-action="login" data-pill-key="login">🔐 <span data-i18n="dock.login">Login</span></div>
      <div data-action="seller" data-pill-key="seller">💸 <span data-i18n="dock.seller">Seller</span></div>
      <div data-action="language" data-pill-key="language">🌐 <span data-i18n="dock.language">Language</span></div>
      <div data-action="engines" data-pill-key="engines" title="AI Engine Preferences">🧠 <span data-i18n="dock.engines">Engines</span></div>
      <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_838 — 删除 Passkey Dock 死按钮: 它没有自己的面板、handleDockAction 无 case,
           点它会去开 Profile 面板 → Dock 又把所有打开面板点亮 → 看起来"最后两个面板一起冒出来"
           (Jing 报的 bug)。通行密钥登录入口仍在 Profile 面板内,不丢功能。 -->
      <div data-action="profile" data-pill-key="profile">👤 <span data-i18n="action.profile">Profile</span></div>
    </footer>

    <div class="toast" id="toast" data-i18n="toast.awakened">CSS awakened · 流流流</div>

    <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_117_STEP_1 — Crash guard. MUST load BEFORE everything
         else so window.onerror / onunhandledrejection / location.reload
         instrumentation catches errors thrown by every later script. -->
    <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_393 — build stamp + auto-update guard (App↔desktop parity).
         Keep window.__CSSOS_BUILD and public/build.txt bumped to the SAME value
         on every deploy so a stale device auto-reloads to the latest build. -->
    <script>window.__CSSOS_BUILD = "20260604-w622";</script>
    <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_513 — neutralize JS-injected :has() (iOS/macOS WebKit crash). MUST be first. -->
    <script src="app.cinema-teardown-debug.js?v=20260606-w655"></script>
    <script src="app.has-neutralizer.js?v=20260530-w515-backdrop"></script>
    <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_518 — diag probe removed (crash investigation done). -->

    <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_490k — :has() storm fix: maintain document-level state classes in JS. -->
    <script src="app.has-class-bridge.js?v=20260529-w490k-hasbridge"></script>
    <script src="app.build-guard.js?v=20260530-w516b-clean"></script>
    <script src="app.crash-guard.js?v=20260530-w536-quiet"></script>
    <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_365 20260523 — Jing: 重新挂回内存遥测探针(此前未在 index.html
         引用 → 5/18 起没有任何样本, OOM 排查完全失明, 尤其 iOS 一条样本都没有).
         每 30s + pagehide/visibility sendBeacon 到 /api/telemetry/memory, 极轻量.
         恢复后才能"边改边看遥测的 dom_nodes/images", 据此决定 OOM 第二刀砍哪里. -->
    <script src="app.memory-probe.js?v=20260530-w536-quiet"></script>
    <script src="app.panel-memory-monitor.js?v=20260604-w636-basebreakdown"></script>
    <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_249 20260520 — Jing: 极早定义 compactLyricLines 全局,
         根治播放时每帧轮询抛 ReferenceError 压垮 webview 看门狗 →
         强刷返回主界面的崩溃. 必须早于所有调用方(watch-audio-polling 等). -->
    <script src="app.lyric-utils.js?v=20260521-w272-cachebust"></script>
    <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_255 — 相同输入重生成: 覆盖旧作品 vs 输出新作品 的选择+记忆.
         独立模块, 高级设置面板回滚动荡时也能用; 暴露 cssosResolveRegenOutputMode(). -->
    <script src="app.regen-output-mode.js?v=20260522-w351-zindex"></script>
    <!-- CSSOS_WAVE_259 — 钱漏#3 接线: 给 mv 生成注入 reuse_ok(重试/续跑复用),
         用户主动重生成时开"求新窗口"强制出新. 必须早加载以包好 fetch. -->
    <script src="app.mv-reuse-flag.js?v=20260521-w272-cachebust"></script>
    <script src="app.ios-app-store-hardening.js?v=20260519-wave233-ios-harden"></script>
